*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  verification of 5GC002255-EC feature in the case of FDD+TDD Classical Fullstack SA
...                                Test EC1 : trafic BE+VONR with No DRX and blind activation 
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed with GOLDEN SCF
...                              in the GOLDEN SCF the parameter MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/NRPMRNL-1/miNrHighRlcReport must be set to 5min
...               Step : 
...                     1) modify commissioning with : sCellActivationMethod=blind, actCDrx=false and actCDrxVoNR=false
...                     2) setup GNB with new commissioning
...                     3) Cell Steup 2 cells 1 FDD and 1 TDD 
...                     4) UE register in SA 
...                     5.1) Setup PDU session for UE : defaut bearer 5QI-6
...                     5.2) modify PDU session for UE : adding signaling VONR bearer 5QI-1
...                     5.3) modify PDU session for UE : adding data VONR bearer 5QI-5
...                     5.4) start trafic for the 3 bearers 
...                        60Mbs DL 10Mbs UL for BE=5QI-6
...                        tcp default for signaling VONR=5QI-1
...                        codec amr_wb_18_25 for data VONR=5QI-5
...                     6) wait 10 minute to have the counters L2_HI RLC and check it :
...                        Check Legacy Counters DL for QOS1, 5 and 6
...                          QOS1 must be egal to 721+/-1 for the codec amr_wb_18_25 in 5 minute
...                          QOS5 must be egal to 618+/-1 for the tcp without data rate in 5 minute
...                          QOS6 must be in range 2265000 and 2288000 in 5min : 60.7 Mbs +/- 0.5%
...                        Check Primary Path Counters for QOS1, 5 and 6
...                          QOS1 must be null : GBR bearer are not CA eligible
...                          QOS5 must be null : due to blind activation all DL trafivc is in Scell
...                          QOS6 must be null : due to blind activation all DL trafivc is in Scell
...                        Check Secondary Path Counters for QOS1, 5 and 6
...                          QOS1 must be null : GBR bearer are not CA eligible
...                          QOS5 must be egal to Legacy QOS5 : due to blind activation all DL trafivc is in Scell
...                          QOS6 must be egal to Legacy QOS6 : due to blind activation all DL trafivc is in Scell
...                     7) stop all trafic and detach UE 
...                     8) Teardown 
...
...               Manual Run : load the PM filter counter file /utils/PM_Counters_filters_for_EC-1_EC-2.xml in WEBUI to see the counters values
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : luc.stenghel@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : luc.stenghel@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation author : luc.stenghel@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation contact: luc.stenghel@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 23-July-2021
...               Modified Date               : 18-August-2023
...               Last Modified by            : loic.marzin@nokia.com
...                    18/08/2023        Refactoring due to BOO_AP_LOO Migration

